  "content": "Not to catastrophize, but it's already kind of an endpoint apocalypse out there for enterprises — especially ever since the pandemic. Locking down devices and ensuring good patch management, MFA, and password practices has gone from being a foundational practice to becoming a stretch goal . So, is it time to move on to flexible, shiny new security operations center (SoC) approaches that leapfrog user behavior and focus on immediate response and dynamically tuned resilience? Yes, yes, a million times yes!",
